/** @page xmlsecreleasenotesguide Release Notes

    @tableofcontents

    @section xmlsec_v_1_0_1 xmlsec Module Version 1.0.1

    <b>Bug Fixes:</b>
    - Apply entity and DTD options per document, including background threads, without changing libxml2 parser defaults
    - Free serialization buffers when Qore string allocation throws
    - Support CMake 4 and optional strict API documentation builds
    - Report an explicit QUnit skip when the optional XML test dependency is unavailable
    - Fixed memory leak in \c QoreXmlDoc::getString() where XML memory allocated by libxml2
      was not being freed after copying to the Qore string
      (<a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore/issues/5107">issue 5107</a>)
    - Fixed \c XmlSecKey::getName() returning incorrect value due to xmlChar pointer cast issue
    - Fixed typo in error message: "could node find node" corrected to "could not find node"
    - Fixed syntax error (extra closing parenthesis) in \c XmlSecKey::setCertificate()
    - Fixed potential null pointer dereference in \c DSigCtx::getTransformStatus()

    <b>Thread Safety Improvements:</b>
    - Added proper locking to \c XmlSecKey::clone() and \c XmlSecKey::copy() methods
    - Added proper locking to \c XmlSecKeyManager::getKeyManager() method
    - Added big_lock synchronization to \c DSigCtx::verify() for consistency with sign operations

    <b>Build System Updates:</b>
    - Updated GitLab CI to use modern k8s tag
    - Fixed GitHub API calls to use correct organization and token-based authentication
    - Updated spec file for CMake-based builds
    - Updated README with CMake build instructions

    <b>Documentation:</b>
    - Added comprehensive usage examples for signing, verification, encryption, and decryption
    - Added documentation for supported key types and formats
    - Added error handling documentation
    - Updated all documentation to reflect current version

    <b>Test Suite:</b>
    - Added comprehensive negative tests for error conditions
    - Added tests for key operations (copy, getName, setName, getType, getSize)
    - Added tests for various key formats
    - Added tests for binary encryption/decryption
    - Added tests for certificate loading methods
    - Added tests for tampered signature detection
    - Added tests for wrong key verification failures
    - Updated test certificates (regenerated with 2048-bit RSA keys)
    - Updated signature templates to use SHA256 instead of deprecated SHA1

    @section xmlsec_v_1_0_0 xmlsec Module Version 1.0.0

    - updated for new xmlsec builds; fixed build and test
      (<a href="https://github.com/qorelanguage/qore/issues/4343">issue 4343</a>)

    @section xmlsec_v_0_0_4 xmlsec Module Version 0.0.4

    - updated for Qore 0.9

    @section xmlsec_v_0_0_3 xmlsec Module Version 0.0.3

    - initial release
